infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title Migrate in risk order, never big-bang
  desc Lowest-risk layer first, so the first breakage stays attributable
  order asc
  sequences
    - label 1. Adopt ruff
      desc Config-only, zero runtime risk. Start with E and F, delete flake8/isort/black configs.
    - label 2. uv as drop-in pip
      desc uv pip install -r requirements.txt — no workflow change, proves the speed.
    - label 3. Lockfile in CI
      desc uv add, commit uv.lock, switch CI to uv sync --frozen so stale locks fail loudly.
    - label 4. uvx for tools
      desc Replace global tool installs with isolated, cached runs.
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #6366f1 #f59e0b #f43f5e
